# known_failures.txt gets lines added at its end by concurrent reviews: union keeps both sides of a
# conflicting hunk. A line both sides added comes twice, which tools/gate_failures.py refuses; a line
# one side removed beside the other's addition comes back, which tools/policy.py refuses once the fix
# deleted its issue. Not for notes/time-limits.md: a digest deleting hits beside an append would
# bring the hits back.
tools/known_failures.txt merge=union
